{
  "dom_id": "step-e2759",
  "name": "Example: Identifying a Polyhedron Given Its Net",
  "problem": "The net of which polyhedron is shown below?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14248692/assets/96e7889a74d2d5bd35634ec022d3c9020d23fd7292b3bd7c05f8722860389645.png)",
  "worked_solution": "We fold the net along its edges to form a solid shape, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14248692/assets/98ee3216b37bdce0081dd4daad1895cace7998a03d41c183184d07f6afaac126.png)\n\nAs a result, we get a triangular pyramid:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14248692/assets/32bdc8f811ca46a184307fa5521cb145cb0add8a0b4ee2bfae25add881561475.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
