  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e2759\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying a Polyhedron Given Its Net</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e2759\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>The net of which polyhedron is shown below?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-1be5a0e49dfb1018f30754b62167b931\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/1be5a0e49dfb1018f30754b62167b931\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <p>We fold the net along its edges to form a solid shape, as shown below.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-a11214c9f9bc779959860d4ec2369df5\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/a11214c9f9bc779959860d4ec2369df5\"></div>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>As a result, we get a triangular pyramid:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-65b8b7bac29b7edd162a5926761f7bab\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/65b8b7bac29b7edd162a5926761f7bab\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
